_sorted/
_REVIEW/
*.log
.DS_Store

# Playwright MCP tooling's scratch output dir, created in the repo root
# during interactive browser-testing sessions -- never project state.
.playwright-mcp/

# Python packaging/build artifacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
# never commit anything the wallet-finder might surface
wallets-found.txt
secrets*

# Raw before/after media captures — real filenames/thumbnails visible,
# needs blurring/cropping before anything here goes public. Local only.
media/raw/

# Hive: local session/runtime state, not project state
.pHive/agent-complete/
.pHive/interrupts/
.pHive/metrics/
.pHive/session-effort.txt

# Tauri desktop shell (src-tauri/) build outputs -- none of this is meant
# to be committed; it's all regenerated by `npm install` + `npm run tauri
# build`/`dev`. `src-tauri/resources/cleanup-ui-onedir/` in particular is a
# ~67MB COPY of the PyInstaller onedir build output
# (packaging/dist/cleanup-ui-onedir/) staged here so Tauri's `bundle.resources`
# can pick it up -- see tauri.conf.json and
# src-tauri/binaries/cleanup-ui-sidecar-stub.sh for how it's consumed.
# Regenerate it with:
#   rm -rf src-tauri/resources/cleanup-ui-onedir && \
#     mkdir -p src-tauri/resources/cleanup-ui-onedir && \
#     cp -R packaging/dist/cleanup-ui-onedir/. src-tauri/resources/cleanup-ui-onedir/
node_modules/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/resources/cleanup-ui-onedir/

# Hive: epics are ignored by default; /plan allowlists each epic dir explicitly
.pHive/epics/*
!.pHive/epics/harden-cleanup-cli/
!.pHive/epics/harden-cleanup-cli/**
# sidecar_retention=transient: HTML sidecars regenerated on demand
.pHive/epics/harden-cleanup-cli/docs/*.html
.pHive/epics/harden-cleanup-cli/index.html
.pHive/epics/harden-cleanup-cli/docs/*.png
!.pHive/epics/ai-approvals-ui/
!.pHive/epics/ai-approvals-ui/**
!.pHive/epics/port-remaining-scripts/
!.pHive/epics/port-remaining-scripts/**
!.pHive/epics/desktop-app-shell/
!.pHive/epics/desktop-app-shell/**
!.pHive/epics/guided-sort-and-cluster/
!.pHive/epics/guided-sort-and-cluster/**
!.pHive/epics/settings-and-transparency/
!.pHive/epics/settings-and-transparency/**
